<translate>
==== CanBeEquipped ==== <!--T:1-->

<!--T:2-->
The area on the body where the object will be placed. All locations can be checked in the file ''media\lua\shared\NPCs\BodyLocations.lua''
<syntaxhighlight lang="Java">
CanBeEquipped = FannyPackFront,
</syntaxhighlight>
</translate>

